><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131290/extras/cb88a885a19444d0407fb93f7f28522e.avif?t=1755007846\" width=600 height=195 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131290/extras/58f2d029fe6f494c8e0141ccd7a61916.poster.avif?t=1755007846\" width=600 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131290/extras/58f2d029fe6f494c8e0141ccd7a61916.webm?t=1755007846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><strong>Mysterious rifts</strong> have been opening up in the skies of Abomi Nation, tearing holes in space and time. Through these rifts, monsters from <strong>all sorts of indie game universes</strong> are pouring out into Abomi Nation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with crossover monsters from <i><strong>Bugsnax, Brotato, Cassette Beasts, Peglin, Bug Fables, Slap City, Monster Sanctuary, Coromon...</strong></i> and so many more! Dozens of universes are being pulled in by the rifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131290/extras/3134302dd829fc7079faed46eff21fa5.avif?t=1755007846\" width=600 height=195 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131290/extras/de7b3f70ae4c462dad73dd6160a0ac4b.poster.avif?t=1755007846\" width=600 height=263 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3131290/extras/de7b3f70ae4c462dad73dd6160a0ac4b.webm?t=1755007846\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Using the in-game <strong>Abomi Nation Creation Station</strong>, players will be able to create custom Abomis, attacks, items, biomes, and types, then share their creations with others via <i><strong>Steam Workshop</strong></i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply upload your sprites, tweak some values like stats and typing, and congratulations! You've created an Abomi of your very own, <strong>no coding experience required</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download other players' creations from <i>Steam Workshop</i> to truly make team combinations <strong>infinite</strong>.</p>",
